OL,3,GNEWSASearch for lads in 1979 Handsworth
OL,4,Aphoto project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photographer has appealed for help in
OL,7,Ffinding two people who took part in a
OL,8,Fpop-up studio shoot nearly 50 years
OL,9,Fago.
OL,11,FBefore the humble selfie became
OL,12,Fpopular, in 1979, Derek Bishton, Brian
OL,13,FHomer and John Reardon invited members
OL,14,Fof the community to take pictures of
OL,15,Fthemselves as part of a project to
OL,16,Farchive inner-city life in Birmingham.
OL,18,FMore than 500 people took part in the
OL,19,Fpop-up sessions, which were set up
OL,20,Foutside a terraced house on Grove Lane
OL,21,Fin Handsworth.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
