OL,3,GNEWSASearch for lads in 1979 Handsworth
OL,4,Aphoto project
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, as Bishton plans to have the
OL,7,Fnostalgic photographs printed in a
OL,8,Fbook, he has managed to track down the
OL,9,Fmajority of the participants except
OL,10,Ftwo, who were boys at the time.
